import VOA.Geometric.GeometricVOA
import VOA.Geometric.ChiralDeRham

/-!
# Geometric incarnations — sketches

"Vertex (operator) algebras are a deep construct and, in spite of their complexity,
are here to stay" (Gannon §5.4). These modules sketch the geometric face of the
theory; they sit at the research frontier and are the most distant goals.

* `GeometricVOA` — binary trees ⇆ spheres-with-tubes (Figs. 5.1–5.3), Huang's
  geometric VOAs, Segal's functor `𝒮`, the sewing axiom, vertex groups (§5.4.1).
* `ChiralDeRham` — vertex operator superalgebras, the chiral de Rham complex
  `MSV_X` of Malikov–Schechtman–Vaintrob, the elliptic genus, Tamanoi's `𝒯(X)`
  (§5.4.2).
-/
